.tox/

# Everything the documentation tells you to generate.
#
# Keep these OUT of the tree: `bulkpr verify checksums` compares the tree against
# CHECKSUMS.sha256 and reports anything extra, so a task tree built in place makes
# the artifact's own self-check fail. README.md and docs/REPRODUCE.md write them
# to /tmp for that reason; these entries are the safety net if you do not.
/clones/
/snapshots/
/tasks/
/jobs/
score.json

# Editors and operating systems
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
